It’s an adjective for a man who has no hair on his head!

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:22.572
Right.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:26.619
It begins with <i>C</i>.

00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:28.449
It’s an adjective.

00:00:28.911 --> 00:00:35.945
It describes a place where there are a lot of people, for example a restaurant or a beach in the summer.

00:00:39.296 --> 00:00:40.008
Right.

00:00:43.755 --> 00:00:45.355
It begins with <i>G</i>.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.803
They’re things which people wear on their hands.

00:00:51.508 --> 00:00:52.237
Right.

00:00:54.878 --> 00:00:56.393
It begins with <i>K</i>.

00:00:57.037 --> 00:00:59.205
