00:01:01.722 --> 00:01:02.439
Right.

00:01:06.036 --> 00:01:07.465
It begins with <i>L</i>.

00:01:08.088 --> 00:01:14.074
It’s an adjective for someone who doesn’t like studying or working, for example.

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:17.022
It’s the opposite of <i>hard-working</i>.

00:01:20.248 --> 00:01:21.118
Right.

00:01:22.932 --> 00:01:24.421
It begins with <i>T</i>.

00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:31.069
It’s a thing which you use in an airport to help you with your cases, or in a

00:01:31.094 --> 00:01:33.447
